# Who We Are

##### DeSutter, Kerr & Associates, Inc. was formed in August of 1995 with a mission of helping small businesses win government contracts in basic service and maintenance industries. Over the years DKA’s expertise broadened to cover virtually all aspects of the federal procurement process.

#### OUR MISSION

The core of our services remains in helping our clients respond to government solicitations; nothing is as rewarding as helping our clients grow their businesses through winning government contracts.

#### A Success Story

DKA has helped its clients win hundreds of government contracts to provide an extremely wide variety of products and services, from Logistics Management to IT, Professional Staffing to various Medical Services, Environmental Services to Mobile Asphalt Plants, and many more.  We’ve also helped our clients obtain HUBZone &  8(a) certifications and contract vehicles, such as CMAS, TXMAS, and the GSA Schedule.  With regard to the GSA Schedule, not only have we helped more than 400 companies get on the Schedule, we’ve also helped them list their products and services on GSA Advantage, modify their GSA catalogs, and provide other maintenance assistance like quarterly sales reporting and Industrial Funding Fee (IFF) payments.

Talk with a member of our team about how DKA can help your company grow in the public sector.

